  "content": {
    "title": "Where is the 2027 Final Four? Location, how to get tickets",
    "text": "April 4, 2026, 6:04 p.m. ETWhen the 2026 Final Four wraps up at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, it will pack its bags and move about 300 miles northeast.The 2027 NCAA men's Final Four will be held at Ford Field in Detroit, the home of the Detroit Lions. It will be the first time Detroit has hosted the NCAA Tournament semifinal matchups since 2009.The Final Four games are scheduled to take place April 3, 2027, with the National Championship game being played April 5, 2027.Meanwhile, the women's Final Four will take place just south, at Nationwide Arena in Columbus, on April 4-6, 2027.The men's bid was a collaborative effort between the Detroit Sports Commission, Visit Detroit, MSU, the City of Detroit, Ford Field and the Lions.“Michigan State University is proud to serve as the Host Institution for the 2027 NCAA Men’s Final Four in Detroit,” MSU athletic director Alan Haller said in the statement when the announcement was made in 2022. “The Final Four creates memories that last a lifetime, and we look forward to partnering with the Detroit Sports Commission, Visit Detroit, Ford Field and the City of Detroit to put on a tremendous event for fans, participating schools and student-athletes.”Michigan State basketball made an appearance in a semifinal game that year, beating UConn, but later losing to North Carolina in the national title game, also held at Ford Field.This year, the Michigan Wolverines are appearing in a Final Four matchup against the Arizona Wildcats that will take place Saturday, April 4. Where is the 2027 Men's Final Four?Location: Ford Field in Detroit.Date: April 3-5, 2027.Host: Michigan State University. Where is the 2027 Women's Final Four?Location: Nationwide Arena in Columbus.Date: April 2-4, 2027.Host: Ohio State University. How to get 2027 Final Four ticketsTicket applications are already available for the 2027 Final Four in Detroit via Ticketmaster. The application is for upper level seats and costs $400 each.There's also a $25 fee to apply that will be refunded if the applicant is not selected.Applicants will be notified by Oct. 31. The deadline to apply is May 31.",
